{"step_index":583,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T01:00:22Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. bỏ mấy cái mục nhỏ này đi\n2. đẩy lên git đi\n3. run lại dự án\n4. oke bây giờ hãy giải thích và giới thiệu từng chức năng, đầu tiên là trnag đánh giá hiện trạng\n5. tiếp theo đến kế hoạch lộ trình: hãy giới thiệu và nói nó liên kết gì với đánh giá hiện trạng\n6. up code leen git di\n7. kéo code mới về và backup đoạn chat trong đó luôn\n8. thiết kế lại phần mốc thời gian\n9. đánh giá hiện trạng và kế hoạch lộ trình thêm dashboard đi\n10. gộp 2 cái lại thành 1 trang chung. phần dashboard ở trên, phần danh sách ở dưới\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User's Goal:** Build and refine a full-featured Digital Architecture Framework Web Application (Khung Kiến trúc Chính quyền Số - KTS) for Vinh Long province based on Decision 1425/QĐ-TTg (Khung KTTTQGS PB 1.0) and Ministry of Science & Technology / Ministry of Public Security guidelines.\n- **Latest User Request:** Merging the Dashboard and the Inventory List into a single unified page (Dashboard at the top, Inventory List/Table at the bottom) without needing to switch tabs via a Segmented button.\n- **Scope & Architecture:**\n  1. `/kts/so-do`: Master Architectural Blueprint (4 national layers + 4 cross-cutting pillars, clean iconic tiles without text truncation, click modal with 389 HT + 9 NV).\n  2. `/kts/hien-trang`: Inventory of 389 systems (Merged: 4 KPI summary cards + 3 health cards + 4 Recharts charts at the top, filtered inventory table/cards with pagination and cross-links at the bottom).\n  3. `/kts/lo-trinh`: 9 Roadmap Projects (Dashboard with layer & department analytics at the top, interactive 3-phase timeline and table at the bottom).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed & Verified Files:**\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx`:\n    - Merged into a single continuous page: Top section contains KPI summary cards, health status boxes, 4 Recharts charts (Layer Health Matrix, Layer Pie Share, Top Departments, Year Deployment History); Bottom section contains the full Inventory List with multi-filter toolbar, Table/Card switcher, and detail modal with cross-linking.\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/so-do/page.tsx`:\n    - Cleaned tile layout to vertical format (Icon on top, 100% full-width title below, no truncation, removed unnecessary tiny badges).\n  - `src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx`:\n    - Enhanced Dashboard with layer execution progress, department delivery, and strategic pillars; Redesigned Timeline view into 3 strategic phases (2026: Khởi động, 2027: Tăng tốc, 2028–2030: Bứt phá) with rich milestone cards and impacted systems badges.\n  - `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx`:\n    - Full screen width (`max-w-[1920px]`) with responsive padding.\n  - `export_chat_history.js`:\n    - Auto-detects active brain directory (`C:\\Users\\ckgam\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd`) and exports chat history to `LICH_SU_TRO_CHUYEN.md`.\n  - **Git Sync:** Latest code and chat logs pushed to GitHub repository [`https://github.com/Ln0og/123.git`](https://github.com/Ln0og/123.git) on branch `main`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Design Decisions\n- **Unified Dashboard + List Layout:** Rather than forcing users to toggle between tabs, placing high-level analytics at the top and the searchable tabular/card inventory directly below creates an intuitive executive workflow.\n- **Card Text Truncation Prevention:** Avoid placing icon, full title, and multiple badges in a single horizontal flex line when in 4-column grid; using a 2-row layout (Icon + Action on top, Title full width below) ensures 100% legibility on all resolutions.\n- **Prisma & SQLite:** Data source is `prisma/dev.db` with 389 systems, 9 roadmap tasks, and 4 departments.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Dev Server:** Running via Next.js Turbopack on `http://localhost:3000` (Task ID: `task-530`).\n- **Active Working Directory:** `e:\\KTS\\123`.\n- **Git Repo:** `https://github.com/Ln0og/123.git` (branch `main`).\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. **Verify `/kts/hien-trang` and `/kts/lo-trinh`** in the browser to confirm the merged Dashboard + List layout matches the user's visual expectations.\n2. If the user wants the same merged layout (Dashboard on top, Table/Timeline directly underneath) on `/kts/lo-trinh` as well, update `src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx`.\n3. Provide walkthrough of the Admin panel (`/admin`) if requested.\n4. Run `export_chat_history.js` and `git push` whenever changes are committed.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep all 389 systems and 9 roadmap tasks fully cross-linked.\n- Maintain compliance with Decision 1425/QĐ-TTg.\n- Ensure all pages load cleanly without console errors.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 45 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789831851459]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789831851459.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15:34Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789917998341]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789917998341.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15:34Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918138848]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789918138848.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15:34Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1789918337737]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/ckgam/.gemini/antigravity/brain/724a6bcd-bcc3-4ca2-973c-d3661f6678bd/.user_uploaded/media_1789918337737.png\nLast Edited: 2026-09-21T00:15